From: Patrice Chotard <patrice.chotard@foss.st.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 17:14:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: st: Add boot-led for stm32mp2 ST boards

Add options/u-boot/boot-led property to specify to U-Boot
the LED which indicates a successful boot.

Change-Id: I0e6d5dc7ad47319a07d3a1d86380f82ea15db814
Signed-off-by: Patrice Chotard <patrice.chotard@foss.st.com>
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20251112-upstream_add_boot-led_for_stm32_boards-v1-13-50a3a9b339a8@foss.st.com
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20251112-upstream_add_boot-led_for_stm32_boards-v1-14-50a3a9b339a8@foss.st.com
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20251112-upstream_add_boot-led_for_stm32_boards-v1-15-50a3a9b339a8@foss.st.com
Signed-off-by: Alexandre Torgue <alexandre.torgue@foss.st.com>
(cherry picked from commit 0dfff7c550f3aa29441d0a5e581161b9eaa58697)
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/583457
Reviewed-by: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/fragment-02-defconfig-addons.config | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/fragment-02-defconfig-addons.config b/arch/arm64/configs/fragment-02-defconfig-addons.config
index dd3a52cc9642..bc77e466b32c 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/fragment-02-defconfig-addons.config
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/fragment-02-defconfig-addons.config
@@ -7,6 +7,7 @@ CONFIG_CORESIGHT_SOURCE_ETM4X=m
 CONFIG_CPUFREQ_DT=m
 CONFIG_CPU_IDLE_GOV_TEO=y
 CONFIG_CRYPTO_DEV_STM32_CRYP=m
+CONFIG_CRYPTO_DEV_STM32_HASH=m
 CONFIG_DEVFREQ_GOV_USERSPACE=m
 CONFIG_DRM=y
 CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_RAYDIUM_RM68200=m
